{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-12-13 14:16:00', 'title': 'MICATU WINS A 2021 S&P GLOBAL PLATTS GLOBAL ENERGY AWARD FOR COMMERCIAL TECHNOLOGY OF THE YEAR', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #GRIDVIEW--MICATU WAS NAMED WINNER OF THE COMMERCIAL TECHNOLOGY OF THE YEAR CATEGORY AT THE 23RD ANNUAL S&P GLOBAL PLATTS GLOBAL ENERGY AWARDS.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-12-13 08:20:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ANALYTICS RELEASES ITS 2022 ENERGY OUTLOOK', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ANALYSTS AT S&P GLOBAL PLATTS, THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION, ANALYSIS AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY RELEASED THEIR 2022 ENERGY OUTLOOK. JENNIFER VAN DINTER, HEAD OF INTEGRATED ANALYTICS, S&P GLOBAL PLATTS, SAID: "ENERGY MARKETS HAVE BEEN ON PERHAPS THE BIGGEST ROLLERCOASTER RIDE IN HISTORY OVER THE PAST TWO YEARS, SEEING BOTH NEGATIVE PRICES AND RECORD PRICES.'}